398
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:29,040
Hold them up! Your cameras, please!

399
00:34:29,040 --> 00:34:35,199
Pick up your phones and press record, because...

400
00:34:35,719 --> 00:34:40,040
...today, should Boom make the announcement, or should they announce it themselves?

401
00:34:40,040 --> 00:34:48,560
Let's make the announcement! Then you should make it today. Go ahead!

402
00:34:51,560 --> 00:34:55,199
Let me think of what to say for a moment. We're making an announcement, we're making an announcement!

403
00:34:55,199 --> 00:35:01,839
Okay, today, we'd like to ask you both something. Why did you ask everyone to hold up their phones and record like this?

404
00:35:01,839 --> 00:35:04,680
Do you have something to tell us?

405
00:35:04,680 --> 00:35:06,960
What is it? One, two, three!

406
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:09,280
Please, go ahead! Raise them!

407
00:35:09,280 --> 00:35:13,764
