408
00:35:19,604 --> 00:35:21,624
[Cheering]

409
00:35:41,839 --> 00:35:44,839
Uh...

410
00:35:48,680 --> 00:35:55,599
Don't flirt with them! Come back here first, darling, or Mom's going to give you a smack!

411
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:58,304
Oh! [Screaming]

412
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:08,520
Lumi, Lumi, come here! Come on, Lumi!

413
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:30,400
Uh...

414
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:34,985
Okay! [Cheering]

415
00:36:35,585 --> 00:36:39,570
[Screaming] [Cheering]

416
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:53,760
Come on, show us your best move! Show us your signature move! What should we call you, girls?

417
00:36:53,760 --> 00:37:01,400
Lumi, Lumi, turn around and face the ladies. Lumi, turn around and face them for a moment!

418
00:37:01,880 --> 00:37:05,400
Where is this little one?

419
00:37:08,335 --> 00:37:10,355
[Cheering]

420
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:19,599
This little one is the child of me and Miu's mom!

421
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:26,760
What are you going to show everyone? I want to tell you that the thing I'm showing you right now...

422
00:37:26,760 --> 00:37:31,079
...is basically a request for medicine!

423
00:37:32,839 --> 00:37:40,599
Lumi, you can't lift your skirt like that! Even if your concept is...

424
00:37:40,599 --> 00:37:46,480
...sexy, playful, and a great dancer. Come on, show us! Can you show us your sexy side?

425
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:52,079
Sexy... Long legs! Long, sexy legs. Say it again: long legs like a...

426
00:37:52,079 --> 00:37:56,040
...model! Long legs like a model. And what does playful look like, Lumi?

427
00:37:56,040 --> 00:38:00,040
Playful...

428
