Oh, oh, oh! Don't! Don't make her mix bubble tea! She's grown up with bubble tea!

429
00:38:06,640 --> 00:38:07,839
Making bubble tea! Yes!

430
00:38:07,839 --> 00:38:12,720
It's like when you're little and they only let you have one kind of treat. That's how she grew up—with bubble tea!

431
00:38:12,720 --> 00:38:15,520
That's how she got to be like this! Yeah!

432
00:38:15,520 --> 00:38:18,440
And you're a great dancer, too. Can you show us some moves? I'm shy!

433
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:21,400
Yes! Wait, wait!

434
00:38:21,400 --> 00:38:22,560
What was that? Music!

435
00:38:22,560 --> 00:38:26,079
Miu's music! Oh, Miu's music!

436
00:38:28,480 --> 00:38:31,480
A little bit!

437
00:38:32,680 --> 00:38:35,680
Go!

438
00:38:38,071 --> 00:38:43,359
[Music] Dance, dance!

439
00:38:44,621 --> 00:38:46,641
[Music]

440
00:38:47,241 --> 00:38:52,319
[Singing] All right, that's enough, darling!

441
00:38:52,599 --> 00:38:56,466
Mom! [Music]

442
00:38:58,920 --> 00:39:04,327
Careful, you'll fall off the stage! You'll fall off the stage! [Music]

443
00:39:08,202 --> 00:39:14,097
[Music] All right, let's hear it for her!

444
00:39:14,097 --> 00:39:18,040
[Cheering] Please take good care of...

445
00:39:18,040 --> 00:39:23,960
...our little Lumi, the daughter of Mom Miu and Mom Lena. Lumi Chutete!

446
00:39:23,960 --> 00:39:27,920
Chutete? What does Chutete mean? It's from our surnames. Chuw... and...

447
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:32,079
...Techamuklaphiwat. Oh, Chutete!

448
00:39:32,079 --> 00:39:36,040
Lumi Chutete! If you say "muted," it sounds like we're going to a temple!

449
00:39:36,040 --> 00:39:40,480
Right? Oh, is that how it works?

450
00:39:40,480 --> 00:39:45,800
Is that how you ask for something sweetly? Yes, that's how you do it!

451
00:39:45,800 --> 00:39:48,880
Oh! Yeah!

452
00:39:48,880 --> 00:39:54,839
Be sweet to Grandma a little! This is Lumi, Lumi!

453
00:39:54,839 --> 00:40:01,960
Lumi, please let everyone show you some love. And now, wait a moment. P'Boom is going to let...

454
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:06,599
...you go and rest. Grandma!

455
00:40:06,599 --> 00:40:13,319
Darling! Let's say bye-bye!

456
00:40:13,520 --> 00:40:17,560
Can you hear me?

457
00:40:17,599 --> 00:40:26,119
Please take care of us. Please look after Lumi and support her...

458
00:40:26,119 --> 00:40:32,720
...and please look after her two moms, too!

459
00:40:33,960 --> 00:40:38,359
Quick, say it! Lumi, can you speak English? Earlier, when you were talking to P'Boom...

460
00:40:38,359 --> 00:40:44,400
...you said you could speak English. You can speak English!

461
00:40:44,400 --> 00:40:51,400
English, please! Hello, hello! My... my grand...

462
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:59,040
My name is... I have to... my name is...

463
00:40:59,040 --> 00:41:02,839
I... and...

464
00:41:03,839 --> 00:41:06,680
Months... Nine months! Nine months old!

465
00:41:06,680 --> 00:41:14,000
My, my, my favorite day is bubble tea!

466
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:17,880
No, that's not it! Yeah!

467
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:24,920
Everyone, this is her official introduction! Take your photos and videos!

468
00:41:24,920 --> 00:41:31,480
Lumi, come here! Lumi needs to go and drink her milk now, because she's nine months old...

469
00:41:31,480 --> 00:41:37,079
...and we need to let all three of them go and rest. Now, let's give a big round of applause to...

470
00:41:37,079 --> 00:41:42,280
...Lumi! And to Nong Noi, too!

471
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:46,880
We'll let all three of them go and say hello to everyone. But before that, I have to explain...

472
00:41:46,880 --> 00:41:52,119
...about the wristbands. P'Pan, please come and take Lumi. Lumi, Lumi!

473
00:41:52,119 --> 00:41:58,040
Lumi, go with Pan, darling. Come forward. Keep walking, nice and steady!

474
00:41:58,040 --> 00:42:07,040
Come forward. Okay, anyone who hasn't received their wristband can go back and collect it at the front before 7:15.

475
00:42:07,040 --> 00:42:12,960
Because we'll be taking photos together shortly. After that, we'll continue for quite a while...

476
00:42:12,960 --> 00:42:17,480
...and then we'll watch the final episode together. First, we'll let the girls go and greet everyone...

477
00:42:17,480 --> 00:42:22,520
...and then we'll take lots of photos. Please keep things orderly, and also...

478
00:42:22,520 --> 00:42:28,200
...if you haven't received your wristband yet, please collect it before 7:15. We'll take a short break from the stage...

479
00:42:28,200 --> 00:42:35,079
...for a moment, and then we'll come back to watch the final episode together!

480
00:42:43,760 --> 00:42:48,720
[Music]

481
00:42:48,720 --> 00:42:52,269
No... [Music]

482
00:42:58,109 --> 00:43:00,129
[Music]

483
00:43:07,934 --> 00:43:09,954
[Music]

484
00:43:11,920 --> 00:43:14,440
Yes... [Music]

485
00:43:14,440 --> 00:43:19,480
[Music]

486
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:22,359
[Music]

487
00:43:22,359 --> 00:43:26,440
[Music]

488
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:36,680
[Music]

489
00:43:36,680 --> 00:43:40,085
[Music]

490
00:43:44,615 --> 00:43:46,635
[Music]

491
00:43:52,599 --> 00:43:57,400
Let's hear it for Lena and Miu!

492
00:43:59,040 --> 00:44:06,319
How was the final episode? Did you enjoy it? Yes! I was standing here the whole time. What should we call you now?

493
00:44:06,319 --> 00:44:11,040
What should we call you? Yeah...

494
00:44:11,040 --> 00:44:18,800
I want to go back to the question we left hanging earlier. [Music] I haven't forgotten. I want to know, because earlier I saw that you hadn't shared yet. Why were you crying?

495
00:44:18,800 --> 00:44:22,760
No, you were crying during the final scene. What would you like to say...

496
00:44:22,760 --> 00:44:29,040
...to the character you've been with for all these months?

497
00:44:29,040 --> 00:44:35,680
Over the past few months... Yes, really, over these past few months...

498
00:44:35,680 --> 00:44:42,880
Pim isn't a purely good character. She's a gray character. She's not completely good...

499
00:44:42,880 --> 00:44:49,480
...or evil, or dark. She's a gray character, and I feel that she has helped me grow as a person...

500
00:44:49,480 --> 00:44:55,800
...and as an actor. She has helped me...

501
00:44:56,839 --> 00:45:02,160
She taught me so many things, and...

502
00:45:02,160 --> 00:45:09,680
...she made me realize that we don't have to understand everything about someone...

503
00:45:09,680 --> 00:45:14,319
...to be able to empathize with them. We don't have to agree with every single thing they do...

504
00:45:14,319 --> 00:45:21,079
...but we can still understand another human being, because every person has good sides and bad sides...

505
00:45:21,079 --> 00:45:27,440
...and sides that people on the outside may never even see. Sometimes, all of that vulnerability is hidden inside...

506
00:45:27,440 --> 00:45:35,520
...and it made me feel that being vulnerable isn't a bad thing at all.

507
00:45:35,520 --> 00:45:41,359
It actually makes you stronger on the inside. Mm-hmm. And what about you?

508
00:45:41,359 --> 00:45:47,440
Honestly, Pa is another character who feels like another chapter of my life.

509
00:45:47,440 --> 00:45:53,200
Playing Pa helped me, as an actor, step outside my comfort zone...

510
00:45:53,200 --> 00:46:00,640
...because I'm not someone who is always good at expressing my feelings. I felt that this role...

511
00:46:00,640 --> 00:46:06,119
...wasn't an easy one, but I managed to do it because I had a great partner...

512
00:46:06,119 --> 00:46:12,000
...like P'Lena. And I also have to thank every actor in this series who made this seemingly impossible...

513
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:17,440
...project come together so beautifully. Without everyone, none of this would have been possible.

514
00:46:17,440 --> 00:46:23,480
I'd also like to thank P'Ao, Patchanee, P'Dew, and all the cast and crew, both in front of and behind the camera...

515
00:46:23,480 --> 00:46:29,359
...the makeup artists, hairstylists, and everyone who has supported us from the very first day until now.

516
00:46:29,359 --> 00:46:35,839
Thank you all so much. And most importantly, I can't forget to thank all the fans who have always...

517
00:46:35,839 --> 00:46:43,359
...sent us so much love, positive energy, and genuine affection for Lena, Miu, and Pim and Pa. I'm so happy...

518
00:46:43,359 --> 00:46:49,880
...that this series brought us together with so many people. Thank you so much. Thank you for having us!

519
00:46:49,880 --> 00:46:54,920
[Applause]

520
00:46:54,920 --> 00:47:00,520
Since the girls have been thanking everyone, I'd like to say thank you, too.

521
00:47:00,520 --> 00:47:08,040
I'd like to thank Channel 3, P'P'Boom, and... there's someone I really must thank...

522
00:47:08,040 --> 00:47:12,960
...the author of the novel *Reverse Please, Love Can You?* Without this novel...

523
00:47:12,960 --> 00:47:18,920
...there would be no Pim and Pa, and there would be no Lena and Miu playing Pim and Pa. The author...

524
00:47:18,920 --> 00:47:24,240
...brought all these characters to life and created a story that allowed everyone to get to know them.

525
00:47:24,240 --> 00:47:29,599
Thank you for letting us travel into the worlds of these two characters. Thank you so much. And...

526
00:47:29,599 --> 00:47:36,520
...I'd also like to thank the whole crew, P'Nai, all the supporting actors. Everyone was amazing...

527
00:47:36,520 --> 00:47:44,960
...and you were our dream team. Thank you so much! And thank you to everyone watching...

528
00:47:44,960 --> 00:47:51,920
...who didn't just enjoy the series, but also analyzed it and discussed...

529
00:47:51,920 --> 00:47:58,040
...the humanity of both characters. I think that's an important part of what makes this series...

530
00:47:58,040 --> 00:48:02,760
...so meaningful for the creators and everyone who made it. Thank you so much...

531
00:48:02,760 --> 00:48:09,200
...for putting your hard work, dedication, and emotions into this series. Thank you. Let's hear it for them!

532
00:48:09,200 --> 00:48:16,440
Let's hear it for Pa! [Applause] And for us, too! This is the final episode of *Pls Love*, and of course...

533
00:48:16,440 --> 00:48:23,079
...the final episode has come to an end, but one thing definitely hasn't ended. Can you show us the book?

534
00:48:23,079 --> 00:48:26,680
Can I see it? I've never seen it before!

535
00:48:26,680 --> 00:48:29,839
Here! Everyone, we have a book, too!

536
00:48:29,839 --> 00:48:37,839
Oh, I thought it was an encyclopedia of love! It's so thick! Let's see it. Open it up!

537
00:48:37,839 --> 00:48:44,160
Now, for anyone who would like to get the official photobook of Lena...

538
00:48:44,160 --> 00:48:49,000
...from this series, it's 1,460 baht. Pre-orders open...

539
00:48:49,000 --> 00:48:55,680
...from November 5 to November 20. You can place your order through... is that right?

540
00:48:55,680 --> 00:49:00,400
Ticket... Yes!

541
00:49:00,400 --> 00:49:03,880
Hey, hey! Wait, are we actually allowed to show this?

542
00:49:03,880 --> 00:49:10,240
It's a collection of behind-the-scenes filming moments. We even have someone here to...

543
00:49:10,240 --> 00:49:16,839
...give us some spoilers. And there's another scene with your love story...

544
00:49:16,839 --> 00:49:21,040
No, P'Moom, you choose for yourself. You choose! I'll let you talk first...

545
00:49:21,040 --> 00:49:26,760
Hey! Go ahead and talk. I'll choose for myself. Say something!

546
00:49:26,760 --> 00:49:33,240
What should I say? Well, from the 5th to the 20th, if you'd like to have this keepsake at home...

547
00:49:33,240 --> 00:49:39,029
...to remember *Pls Love*... [Clears throat]

548
00:49:46,640 --> 00:49:54,839
The fans at home would love to see it. There are so many pictures, and not a single page looks the same!

549
00:49:54,839 --> 00:49:58,240
How much was it again? 1,460...

550
00:49:58,520 --> 00:50:02,760
...60? Don't give them the wrong price! It's 1,460 baht!

551
00:50:02,760 --> 00:50:08,720
Because at first someone said 60, and then in the interview it was 90, right? I'm not sure anymore. Let's just say 1,500...

552
00:50:08,720 --> 00:50:15,359
...baht, with change! Yes, don't forget! Everyone, remember this!

553
00:50:15,359 --> 00:50:21,480
It's available from November 5 to 20. But honestly, it might sell out on the first day, so don't forget!

554
00:50:21,480 --> 00:50:25,640
For anyone who wants to support the girls, and one more thing: we also have to thank their sponsors...

555
00:50:25,640 --> 00:50:30,559
...so thank you so much. In addition to Pan, thank you to Valin Guta...

556
00:50:30,559 --> 00:50:37,920
...Radiance, for helping your skin look bright and radiant. You can feel the difference in five days! Now, this moment...

557
00:50:37,920 --> 00:50:43,680
...might not be in the book, but P'Boom would like to take a photo with the girls...

558
00:50:43,680 --> 00:50:52,200
...to capture this special moment and make a beautiful memory. Now, let's do a selfie! Should we make a sea of stars?

559
00:50:52,200 --> 00:50:57,520
Should we make a sea of stars? Is this a video or a photo? Is it a video or a still picture?

560
00:50:57,520 --> 00:51:06,440
A still picture. We don't need a sea of stars or we won't be able to see their faces! But a sea of stars is beautiful, too. Let's do it!

561
00:51:06,440 --> 00:51:14,599
Come on, sea of stars! Hey, I love it! I really like the sea of stars!

562
00:51:14,599 --> 00:51:18,599
