596
00:54:27,280 --> 00:54:32,799
And now, after all these wonderful memories, we're going to...

597
00:54:32,799 --> 00:54:40,079
...say goodbye. I'd really like to thank the fans today. Lena...

598
00:54:40,680 --> 00:54:45,359
Would you like to say something to thank the fans? Oh...

599
00:54:45,359 --> 00:54:48,847
[Sigh] [Music]

600
00:54:49,640 --> 00:54:56,079
Before I started working on this series, we had quite a few discussions about the characters. But everyone made me feel at ease...

601
00:54:56,079 --> 00:55:01,079
...and really opened my heart to playing this character. I didn't want there to be even one moment...

602
00:55:01,079 --> 00:55:06,240
...when I didn't give this character everything I had, because I knew everyone was really looking forward to seeing Pim and Pa...

603
00:55:06,240 --> 00:55:12,359
...and I put so much effort into preparing for all of you watching.

604
00:55:12,359 --> 00:55:19,359
I hope that all the hard work we put into this project was worth it for everyone. For me, today...

605
00:55:19,359 --> 00:55:24,240
...has been worth it more than anything. This has been one of the happiest chapters...

606
00:55:24,240 --> 00:55:31,599
...of my life, and I'm so proud to have been part of it. Thank you to everyone who has always supported Miu and...

607
00:55:31,599 --> 00:55:38,720
...P'Lena. Thank you so much. You are all our power and our constant encouragement.

608
00:55:38,720 --> 00:55:45,400
You gave me the strength to keep going during filming and to make this the best work I possibly could. I love you all so much.

609
00:55:45,400 --> 00:55:48,400
...from the bottom of my heart.

610
00:55:49,160 --> 00:55:53,160
Ah... And now...

611
00:55:53,160 --> 00:56:00,520
Well, we've already said quite a lot, haven't we? But...

612
00:56:00,520 --> 00:56:06,119
How should I begin? Hmm... This project means so much to me.

613
00:56:06,119 --> 00:56:11,799
I feel that this has been a very meaningful project for me.

614
00:56:12,119 --> 00:56:18,839
I put so much effort into it, and I knew that in the end, this character...

615
00:56:18,839 --> 00:56:23,920
...would probably be criticized.

616
00:56:23,920 --> 00:56:31,839
But I want everyone to learn that human beings don't have just one side. We have so many different sides...

617
00:56:31,839 --> 00:56:39,480
...and we can't judge someone based only on what we see. Sometimes, there may be many things going on that we don't know about. I hope this series...

618
00:56:39,480 --> 00:56:46,480
...will show everyone that some people's love language isn't just saying "I love you." It's also...

619
00:56:46,480 --> 00:56:51,000
...the little things they do for you every single day.

620
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:57,640
I hope everyone finds a beautiful love and is happy every day. Let's hear it for Lena and Miu!

621
00:56:57,640 --> 00:57:03,319
[Applause] And that brings us to the end of *Pls Love*, the final episode!

622
00:57:03,319 --> 00:57:07,440
Thank you, everyone. We'll let the two girls touch up their makeup, and then we'll have the hi-bye session...

623
00:57:07,440 --> 00:57:12,640
...today. After this, we'll do the hi-bye in an orderly manner. Thank you all so much. We hope to see you again...

624
00:57:12,640 --> 00:57:18,134
...at another event. Have a safe journey home. Goodbye!

625
00:57:18,134 --> 00:57:21,000
[Cheering] [Music]

626
00:57:21,000 --> 00:57:28,880
Speaking of... [Applause] I want to talk about... Okay, here we go again! You're setting me up!

627
00:57:28,920 --> 00:57:34,119
I'll be a witness. I'll be a witness! Let me open the book first. Can I have the book, please?

628
00:57:34,119 --> 00:57:39,440
Can I have the book? If we're going to talk about each other, we need the book. Please bring it over!

629
00:57:39,440 --> 00:57:44,000
The book! Bring me the book!

630
00:57:44,000 --> 00:57:48,680
Love... jealousy... jealousy!

631
00:57:50,480 --> 00:57:53,920
Do you admit it?

632
00:57:54,680 --> 00:58:02,480
I'm wearing red! The crew said red and black, so I dressed up like a cushion. I'm so confused!

633
00:58:04,680 --> 00:58:07,680
All right...

634
00:58:07,960 --> 00:58:16,319
Honestly, one habit I've picked up from Pim is being sharp-tongued. I feel that...

635
00:58:17,039 --> 00:58:21,480
...I haven't really had many chances to say this to her face.

636
00:58:21,480 --> 00:58:25,880
Mm. But what would you like to say to her?

637
00:58:25,880 --> 00:58:28,880
Yeah...

638
00:58:30,119 --> 00:58:34,400
But... The reason Pim and Pa turned out the way they did...

639
00:58:34,400 --> 00:58:42,599
...is because of her, too. I believe everyone can see that she was there with me in every scene. She gave me energy and emotion...

640
00:58:42,599 --> 00:58:48,920
...and everything I needed in every scene. She was always there beside me.

641
00:58:48,920 --> 00:58:53,480
She tried to... ...entertain me and help me whenever I...

642
00:58:53,480 --> 00:58:58,400
...felt down. She always tried to make me smile...

643
00:58:58,400 --> 00:59:07,319
...during my bad days. Yeah, I love her so much.

644
00:59:07,520 --> 00:59:09,540
[Applause]

645
00:59:15,380 --> 00:59:17,401
[Music]

646
00:59:23,200 --> 00:59:29,680
We've been through so much together, haven't we? From the time we first started this journey...

647
00:59:29,680 --> 00:59:35,039
...we knew there would be some rough days along the way. But in the end...

648
00:59:35,039 --> 00:59:41,960
...we made those difficult days worthwhile. And we were so lucky, because it made us love each other...

649
00:59:41,960 --> 00:59:48,680
...even more and get to know each other better. I honestly can't think of a single moment I'd want to go back and change...

650
00:59:48,680 --> 00:59:53,839
...or anything I'd want to ask for differently. And thank you for choosing me...

651
00:59:53,839 --> 00:59:59,160
...as your partner. And yeah, everything that happened...

652
00:59:59,160 --> 01:00:06,839
...has brought us here, and I hope we'll stay this way forever. Thank you, and I love you!

653
01:00:08,760 --> 01:00:13,480
Let's hear it for Lena and Miu!

654
01:00:14,986 --> 01:00:17,006
[Music]

655
01:00:17,400 --> 01:00:23,520
This special moment will stay with us and in everyone's hearts forever.

656
01:00:23,520 --> 01:00:29,520
None of this would have been possible without all of you. Give yourselves a round of applause!

657
01:00:29,520 --> 01:00:34,880
Thank you! After this, we'll have the hi-bye session. We'll let the girls touch up their makeup. Thank you, everyone. Have a safe...

658
01:00:34,880 --> 01:00:40,587
...journey home. Goodbye! Goodbye! [Music]

659
01:00:47,081 --> 01:00:49,101
[Music]

660
01:00:51,667 --> 01:00:53,687
[Music]